{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月3日，據韓媒The Elec報道，<strong>三星電子已向8英寸晶圓代工客户通報，計劃在2030年底前全面終止相關產線運營</strong>。此前三星僅表態「逐步縮減」，此次是首次給出明確的退出時間節點。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584888.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:25.901572+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:49:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_hash":"7243f4356fcccde57979cb58a281b38d960b8271872de88ed0d682a34cd9fb05","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}